How to read this:
  %ideal near 100%  pure traffic saturates the empirical RO peak;
                     the denominator and timing protocol agree.
  %ideal << 100%    stream kernel or rotation is not HBM-bound, or
                     the measured_bw_gbps argument is too high.
  ideal_us column    theoretical floor at the measured denominator;
                     compare fused-kernel cold_us against this, not
                     against the stream time alone.

